AGENTS.md

# Generated load-test payloads are kept locally; individual raw JSON files can
# exceed GitHub's 100 MiB limit. Compact analyses, evidence and figures remain
# versioned. README files document how to reproduce and verify the omitted raw.
/results/lab2/
/results/lab2_final/raw/*
!/results/lab2_final/raw/README.md
/results/lab2_excluded_no_drain/*
!/results/lab2_excluded_no_drain/README.md

# Lab 3 per-request JSON Lines are immutable local primary data and can be
# hundreds of megabytes. Compact summaries, hashes, metrics and figures stay
# versioned so every omitted raw file remains identifiable and reproducible.
/results/lab3_final/raw/*.jsonl

